---
/** A daily-life metaphor for RSV → K → D. Values are illustrative, not market data. */
import BearAvatar from '@/components/bears/BearAvatar.astro';
---

<figure class="elevator">
  <div class="elevator__head">
    <span class="elevator__tag">生活比喻</span>
    <h4>把最近 9 天的價格想成一棟 100 層大樓</h4>
  </div>

  <div class="elevator__body">
    <div class="elevator__scene" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="elevator__building">
        <span class="elevator__floor elevator__floor--100">100 頂樓</span>
        <span class="elevator__floor elevator__floor--80">80</span>
        <span class="elevator__floor elevator__floor--50">50</span>
        <span class="elevator__floor elevator__floor--20">20</span>
        <span class="elevator__floor elevator__floor--0">0 大廳</span>
        <div class="elevator__high-zone">高檔區</div>
        <div class="elevator__low-zone">低檔區</div>
        <div class="elevator__car">
          <span>今日收盤</span>
          <strong>第 86 層</strong>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <ol class="elevator__steps">
      <li>
        <span class="elevator__step-no">1</span>
        <div>
          <strong>RSV 是「電梯今天停在哪一層」</strong>
          <p>近 9 日最低價當 0 樓、最高價當 100 樓。今天收在靠近頂樓的位置，RSV 就高。</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <BearAvatar bear="duo" mood="excited" size={58} decorative />
        <div>
          <strong>K 像腳步快的阿多</strong>
          <p>他會往今天的樓層移動，但會參考昨天的位置，所以比 RSV 穩一點、轉彎也比較快。</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <BearAvatar bear="jun" mood="thinking" size={58} decorative />
        <div>
          <strong>D 像慢一步的阿均</strong>
          <p>他跟著 K 移動，而且再多想一下，所以線條更平滑，也總是比 K 慢半拍。</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>

  <figcaption>
    電梯停在 80 樓以上，只表示它最近常待在高樓層，<strong>不代表下一站一定往下。</strong>
    強勢行情甚至會一路停在高樓層——這就是後面要學的「高檔鈍化」。
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .elevator {
    margin: 1.75rem 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 2px solid var(--c-line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-bear);
    background: var(--c-surface);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sticker);
  }

  .elevator__head {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--c-line);
    background: var(--c-accent-wash);
  }

  .elevator__head h4 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .elevator__tag {
    padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
    border: 2px solid var(--c-line);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--c-accent);
    color: var(--c-ink);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .elevator__body {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(13rem, 0.82fr) minmax(0, 1.7fr);
    gap: 1.2rem;
    align-items: stretch;
    padding: 1rem;
  }

  .elevator__scene {
    min-height: 21rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 3.2rem 0.85rem 2.8rem;
    border: 2px dashed var(--c-line-soft);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    background: var(--c-surface-2);
  }

  .elevator__building {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 10rem;
    height: 100%;
    min-height: 19rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    border: 3px solid var(--c-line);
    border-radius: 0.7rem 0.7rem 0.25rem 0.25rem;
    background:
      repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 0, transparent calc(10% - 1px), var(--c-line-soft) calc(10% - 1px), var(--c-line-soft) 10%),
      var(--c-surface);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sticker-sm);
  }

  .elevator__building::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: -0.65rem 18% auto;
    height: 0.65rem;
    border: 3px solid var(--c-line);
    border-bottom: 0;
    border-radius: 0.5rem 0.5rem 0 0;
    background: var(--c-accent);
  }

  .elevator__high-zone,
  .elevator__low-zone {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 0;
    right: 0;
    left: 0;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    color: var(--c-ink-soft);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .elevator__high-zone {
    top: 0;
    height: 20%;
    background: var(--c-accent-wash);
  }

  .elevator__low-zone {
    bottom: 0;
    height: 20%;
    background: var(--c-brand-wash);
  }

  .elevator__floor {
    position: absolute;
    right: calc(100% + 0.45rem);
    z-index: 3;
    color: var(--c-ink-soft);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    white-space: nowrap;
    transform: translateY(50%);
  }

  .elevator__floor--100 { top: -0.5rem; transform: none; }
  .elevator__floor--80 { bottom: 80%; }
  .elevator__floor--50 { bottom: 50%; }
  .elevator__floor--20 { bottom: 20%; }
  .elevator__floor--0 { bottom: -0.45rem; transform: translateY(100%); }

  .elevator__car {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 2;
    right: 12%;
    bottom: 78%;
    left: 12%;
    display: grid;
    min-height: 3.5rem;
    place-items: center;
    padding: 0.25rem;
    border: 3px solid var(--c-line);
    border-radius: 0.55rem;
    background: var(--c-brand);
    color: var(--c-ink);
    box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--c-shadow);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .elevator__car::before,
  .elevator__car::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 2px;
    background: var(--c-line);
  }

  .elevator__car::before { left: 33%; }
  .elevator__car::after { right: 33%; }

  .elevator__car span,
  .elevator__car strong {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    padding-inline: 0.18rem;
    border-radius: 0.2rem;
    background: var(--c-brand);
  }

  .elevator__car span {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .elevator__car strong {
    font-size: 0.86rem;
  }

  .elevator__steps {
    display: grid;
    align-content: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .elevator__steps li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 3.6rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 0.65rem;
    align-items: center;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.65rem 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--c-line-soft);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    background: var(--c-surface-2);
  }

  .elevator__steps :global(.bear-avatar) {
    align-self: end;
    justify-self: center;
  }

  .elevator__step-no {
    display: grid;
    width: 2.15rem;
    height: 2.15rem;
    place-self: center;
    place-items: center;
    border: 2px solid var(--c-line);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--c-accent);
    color: var(--c-ink);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .elevator__steps strong {
    color: var(--c-ink);
    font-size: 0.94rem;
  }

  .elevator__steps p {
    margin: 0.15rem 0 0;
    color: var(--c-ink-soft);
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .elevator figcaption {
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem 0.85rem;
    border-top: 2px dashed var(--c-line-soft);
    background: var(--c-brand-wash);
    color: var(--c-ink-soft);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .elevator figcaption strong {
    color: var(--c-ink);
  }

  @media (max-width: 42rem) {
    .elevator__body {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .elevator__scene {
      min-height: 18rem;
    }

    .elevator__building {
      min-height: 16rem;
    }
  }
</style>
